"P2664257822" "I just got word that the Freakshow are tearing up the office of a webzine called Hypertypes that follows Paragon City's super-powered scene. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can you go to that office and save those reporters from the Freakshow?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2117390891" "Go to the office and save the reporters from the Freakshow"
// SendOffString :
"P3860290592" "Hypertypes reports on the activities of all super-powered individuals, both heroes and villains alike. Perhaps they found out something the Freakshow doesn't want in the public eye."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2348792634" "Defeat all Freaks in office"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P73899027" "Hypertypes' office is still under siege by the Freakshow!"

