// Dialog :
"P3689601481" "It's a shame you weren't able to save that Schwartzwald fellow; it sounds like he was the Freakshow's primary target. At least you were able to recover his files. Most of these notes do seem to be about the Freakshow, though I'm afraid they'd only make sense to Schwartzwald himself. Maybe he got to close to something. There are several references to meetings with a man named Joe Baker; maybe he can tell us more about the Freakshow's attack."
// RandomFameString :
"P3861524967" "I hear that {HeroName} is on to something big involving the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4003935577" "I'm determined that the Freakshow will go down for the murder of that reporter, Mike Schwartzwald. I've located the Joe Baker mentioned in Schwartzwald's files. Turns out Mr. Baker is a mid-level manager at Crey Industries. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I managed to contact him, and he agreed to meet with you.</A> He sounded really nervous. I'd recommend that you be ready for just about anything."
// AcceptString :
"P1529402645" "Meet with Joe Baker"
// SendOffString :
"P3951704847" "Maybe Mr. Baker knows what Schwartzwald was investigating. That information could tell us why the Freakshow killed him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P566704627" "Meet Joe Baker"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1261171025" "Have you spoken to Baker yet? I need to know what he has to say about the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2147274619" "This is the place Joe Baker asked to see you, but you can't shake the feeling that he isn't the only one waiting for you."

