// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1678974822" "Joe Baker"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3169111382" "I am not a brave man. Please, let me tell you what I know."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1709832593" "You've spoken with Joe Baker, and learned some interesting information."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3104740778" "Mr. Baker owes you his life, but he still won't testify to what he knows. Crey using the Freakshow as hired thugs? There have been rumors, but still. You know, that sheds some new light on that murdered reporter's notes. I'm going to read over them again. Check back with me soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3968570594" "Based on our new information that the Freakshow are working with Crey, I've uncovered a pattern in their attacks. They make a lot of random hits, true, but they also consistently attack businesses owned by Crey rivals. Those attacks are usually timed to ruin the competitor's ability to compete with Crey. Of course, the Freaks also raid Crey from time to time, so I can't be sure of anything. According to Schwartzwald's notes, the next Crey-sponsored Freakshow attack should be against a company called UniMaxComm. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Would you protect them from this potential attack?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3284687941" "Protect UniMaxComm from a potential attack"
// SendOffString :
"P2322899856" "Thanks, {HeroName}. I'll call UniMaxComm and let them know they're in good hands."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P160819822" "Defeat all Freaks in lab"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3242001428" "I need you over at UniMaxComm, {HeroName}. We have to protect them from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1041823579" "Before you even open the door, you hear the sound of malicious laughter. The Freakshow is here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P492019217" "Technician"
// Description :
"P1892720870" "technicians to rescue"
// SingularDescription :
"P757611172" "Rescue the last technician!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P511788735" "Thank goodness you came to help us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P384148376" "You protected the UniMaxComm offices from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3222190661" "Looks like we were right. Dreck, the Freakshow leader, is hiring his men out as mercenaries to Crey. I'll go back to Schwartzwald's notes on their activities; maybe I can find some more connections."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1325864772" "It certainly seems clear that Dreck has been hiring the Freakshow out to Crey as mercenaries. I dug deeper into the notes Schwartzwald made before he died, and I found a mention of an upcoming meeting between the Freakshow and the Council. I don't know what they're up to, but the Freakshow are maniacs; working with the Council, they'll be twice as bad. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to break up that meeting between the Freaks and the Council.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3189648090" "Break up the meeting"
// SendOffString :
"P3918317280" "The meet is going down in a war-torn coastal area that I've isolated with an emergency force field. I'd like to see the lead negotiators in jail, {HeroName}. I hope they can tell us more about these strange alliances."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3820147878" "Bust lead negotiators & their guards"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1595332826" "That meeting between the Freakshow and the Council could tell us a lot. I need you to get over there."

