// Variable - BOSS_TWO_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - LeadNegotiators 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3600752687" "You defeated the negotiators and prevented an alliance between the Freakshow and the Council."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2642637589" "Most of the Freaks you put in jail won't talk, but one of them was willing to cut a deal. It seems the Freakshow steal most of the chemicals and cybernetics they need, but sometimes there are things that they just can't get through theft. When that happens, Dreck sells the services of his loyal Freaks to get whatever he needs to keep his never-ending party going."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1928145450" "{HeroName}, the Freakshow have started fighting among themselves. It looks like Freaks who are loyal to Dreck are making hits against those loyal to Bile the Technophile. That's not so unusual, but it made me go back to Schwartzwald's notes, and I found something. Turns out that most of Schwartzwald's mystery informants were Freaks in Bile's faction. Could it be that Dreck has identified them as a threat? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to investigate this strange Freakshow strife.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P524777376" "Investigate the Freakshow strife"
// SendOffString :
"P3860209209" "Ok, I've identified a Freak called the ZikZak Man who runs a group of techno-anarchists. He was one of Schwartzwald's contacts, and he's come under fire from Dreck loyalists. I'd like you to talk to him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3477422333" "Talk to the ZikZak Man"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3857749545" "Have you spoken to the ZikZak Man? I want to hear what he has to say about this strange conflict between the Freakshow factions."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1871788272" "The sound of gunfire rings through the air, the mad rhythm section of an urban nightmare."

