// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1303750929" "You've talked to the ZikZak Man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3363608051" "ZikZak put all of the information about the Freakshow's mercenary activities out on the Internet. {HeroName}, the Freakshow factions are going to explode! It barely matters if the information's true or not. When the fighting starts, it's going to be tough just to keep the warring Freakshow factions from taking half the city with them. Things have just gotten much worse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1771581342" "ZikZak's published all of Schwartzwald's findings to the Internet: the Freakshow's mercenary actions, their ties to Crey, all of it. It's started an intense war among the Freakshow factions. For the most part, they're sticking behind Dreck, but that's probably just pack instinct. The more ideological factions are trying to go out on their own. One of those is Clamor's group of anti-corporate militarists. I have good word that they're uniting behind a Freak named Clamor Boi. They're planning to break Clamor out of jail, along with that young Freak faction leader, Upstart. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I need you to take them out before they can effect a prison break.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1466747514" "Take Clamor Boi out before he can effect a prison break"
// SendOffString :
"P1575879723" "I'd advise you to get some allies with you on this one. Clamor Boi won't be easily stopped."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4248583268" "Defeat Clamor Boi and his men"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2475816651" "If Clamor Boi and his men free those jailed Freakshow leaders, it'll be a disaster!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3830247331" "The sewers seem like a strange place for a meeting, but the Freakshow are pretty strange people."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3796110070" "Clamor Boi"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3483223838" "I can't wait to see Lady Clamor again. She won't take anything from that traitor Dreck."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1515608247" "You won't stop this! Lady Clamor will be free again!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P323853786" "You have defeated Clamor Boi and put a stop to his plot to free the jailed Freakshow leaders."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3689374069" "With Clamor Boi in jail, the plan to free Clamor and Upstart will dissolve. That's a big victory for you, {HeroName}. If those Freakshow faction leaders had been freed, they would have exacerbated the fighting among the Freakshow groups. And the public would have been the ones to pay the price."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission7 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2563601708" "It looks like Dreck's trying to put a stop to the fighting among the Freakshow, by reestablishing his street cred with all of the factions. He plans to do it by ordering raids against Crey facilities all over the city. That might convince the Freaks that he really is the bold, violent leader they're looking for, but it's also going to result in a lot of civilian injuries. I'm calling in all my hero contacts on this one, {HeroName}. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you stop one of the Freakshow raids?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3754224726" "Stop one of the Freakshow raids"
// SendOffString :
"P2738254865" "There may be a lot of dirty work going on behind the scenes at Crey, but there are also a lot of innocent people working for them."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1895416611" "Defeat all Freakshow raiders"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2075543604" "That Freakshow raid could result in a lot of casualties. I'm counting on you to save the day."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2765409675" "The Crey security forces have been overwhelmed. It looks like it's all up to you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3530203318" "Should we try to extract the staff?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P704362372" "Heck, no. Upload the important files to the network, then get out."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P4129316643" "technicians to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1853472207" "Save the last technician!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1562485812" "You have saved the Crey facility from the Freakshow."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2817627800" "Thanks for stopping that Freakshow raid, {HeroName}. You and the rest of my hero contacts really went to work on this wave of Freakshow violence, but it looks like these defeats have only exacerbated the Freaks' rebellious natures. I'm hearing reports of Freak on Freak violence all over town. Dreck's going to have a tough time keeping that madcap group of misfits together. Of course, if their violence becomes too widespread, the city as a whole could be in trouble."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Lvl6_Freakshow_Mission8 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P197734540" "It seems the Freaks' recent defeat at your hands really shook their faith in their leader, Dreck. I thought the Freaks were chaotic before, but now their inner squabbling has descended into an all-out war! Someone's got to stop the Freakshow fighting before it gets really out of hand."
// AcceptString :
"P1332451220" "Stop Freakshow fighting"
// SendOffString :
"P1860608482" "Those Freaks are out for blood, {HeroName}, and they'd be happy to spill some of yours."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P317096546" "Defeat Freak leaders, their crews"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P106314051" "I need you to contain this Freakshow faction war!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2031835271" "A techno beat provides a sick accompaniment to the chaotic sounds of battle."

